Attribution
-----------
The RFC 3161 sealing flow in src/holdout_audit/seal.py (query with nonce via
`openssl ts -query -cert`, POST to DigiCert and FreeTSA, double verification of each
reply against the imprint and the query file with pinned CA files, reply-time parsing,
and "a TSA outage is a failed receipt, never a crash") is adapted from a timestamp
client in the maintainers' earlier private research code (2026). It was rewritten for
this package; no code is imported from that code base.

Third-party certificates
------------------------
src/holdout_audit/certs/ contains public CA/TSA certificates downloaded from their
issuers, used only to verify timestamp tokens:
  - DigiCert Trusted Root G4       https://cacerts.digicert.com/DigiCertTrustedRootG4.crt.pem
  - FreeTSA root CA and TSA cert   https://freetsa.org/files/cacert.pem, https://freetsa.org/files/tsa.crt

Statistical methods
-------------------
The statistics implement published methods; each module cites its source papers
(see docs/METHODS.md). No third-party code from those papers is included.
